{
 "chapter": 21,
 "title": "Everything, in order",
 "duration": 169.06666666666538,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 4.799999999999997,
   "end": 9.95913832199546,
   "text": "One rung at a time, from the bottom. Everything Part One has built.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.699999999999996,
   "end": 14.134965986394553,
   "text": "investment: spend now, earn later",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.36666666666666,
   "end": 17.21696145124716,
   "text": "some of it is sunk \u2014 never got back",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.466666666666658,
   "end": 20.351791383219947,
   "text": "the future arrives a bit at a time",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.600000000000016,
   "end": 22.811746031746047,
   "text": "the chance usually keeps",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.233333333333412,
   "end": 28.581315192743844,
   "text": "so waiting pays: bad half cut, good half kept",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.800000000000104,
   "end": 31.325215419501237,
   "text": "not about disliking risk",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.566666666666794,
   "end": 35.12517006802734,
   "text": "waiting costs profit \u21d2 a level to act at",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.36666666666681,
   "end": 38.472380952381094,
   "text": "the trigger sits above the textbook line",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.90000000000007,
   "end": 43.13342403628125,
   "text": "how far: choppiness and the cost of money",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.36666666666671,
   "end": 48.20226757369619,
   "text": "base case \u2248 double \u00b7 rough trade > 3\u00d7",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.43333333333335,
   "end": 50.52897959183675,
   "text": "cheaper money RAISES it",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.76666666666666,
   "end": 54.49931972789115,
   "text": "in reverse: absorb losses before quitting",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.93333333333325,
   "end": 60.08394557823121,
   "text": "the do-nothing band \u2248 9\u00d7 wider",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.33333333333322,
   "end": 63.406802721088326,
   "text": "up and back down \u2014 the effect stays",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.63333333333319,
   "end": 67.10866213151913,
   "text": "hysteresis \u2014 the dollar and the imports",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.33333333333317,
   "end": 72.25020408163249,
   "text": "cushion the downside \u21d2 early in; lift the upside \u21d2 late out",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.69999999999978,
   "end": 77.47909297052132,
   "text": "many firms \u21d2 an industry that looks frozen",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.99999999999959,
   "end": 94.151519274376,
   "text": "And the master scale in its final form. Give up at nought point seven two. Build at one point six two. And in between, a wide stretch where the right thing to do is nothing.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.39999999999947,
   "end": 101.05297052154141,
   "text": "It does not say firms are irrational. It says the opposite.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.49999999999943,
   "end": 104.98199546485203,
   "text": "It does not say waiting is always right.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 105.3999999999994,
   "end": 110.9051700680266,
   "text": "And it does not apply where a rival can snatch the opportunity away from you.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.23333333333262,
   "end": 118.44045351473852,
   "text": "So go back to the two people we opened with, and let Nell explain them.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 118.86666666666596,
   "end": 129.7249433106569,
   "text": "The farmer keeps going because closing is final. Staying open keeps the good years possible, and that is worth more to him than the losses are costing him.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 130.96666666666593,
   "end": 142.27623582766367,
   "text": "And I do not build, because building is final too. Waiting another year is worth something, and this year's numbers are not yet good enough to pay for it.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 143.99999999999918,
   "end": 153.9786848072554,
   "text": "One more thing before we stop. A government somewhere spent hundreds of billions of pounds on a policy that assumed none of this was true.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 158.29999999999896,
   "end": 160.46530612244794,
   "text": "the whole ladder, in order",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 160.5999999999989,
   "end": 163.27614512471544,
   "text": "not irrational \u00b7 not always right",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 163.3999999999988,
   "end": 166.70308390022558,
   "text": "next: a policy that assumed none of it",
   "voice": "n"
  }
 ],
